<mart. 12.55.5>	-Sed uendat: bene basiare quantum est!-,
<mart. 12.55.6>	Hoc uendit quoque nec leui rapina:
<mart. 12.55.7>	Aut libram petit illa Cosmiani
<mart. 12.55.8>	Aut binos quater a noua moneta,
<mart. 12.55.9>	Ne sint basia muta, ne maligna,
