<mart. 12.57.9>	Illinc palucis malleator Hispanae
<mart. 12.57.10>	Tritum nitenti fuste uerberat saxum;
<mart. 12.57.11>	Nec turba cessat entheata Bellonae
<mart. 12.57.12>	Nec fasciato naufragus loquax trunco,
<mart. 12.57.13>	A matre doctus nec rogare Iudaeus,
<mart. 12.57.14>	Nec sulphuratae lippus institor mercis.
