<mart. 12.57.17>	Cum secta Colcho Luna uapulat rhombo.
<mart. 12.57.18>	Tu, Sparse, nescis ista nec potes scire,
<mart. 12.57.19>	Petilianis delicatus in regnis,
<mart. 12.57.20>	Cui plana summos despicit domus montis,
<mart. 12.57.21>	Et rus in urbe est uinitorque Romanus
<mart. 12.57.22>	-Nec in Falerno colle maior autumnus-
